  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> is even, the greatest coefficient is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;&nbsp; The greatest term&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><msup><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo></mrow> </math> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />and&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>x</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac></math><br /><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac></math>",
